####  pub fn  reserve  (&mut self, additional: [ usize
](../primitive.usize.html) )

Reserves capacity for at least ` additional ` more elements to be inserted in
the ` HashMap ` . The collection may reserve more space to speculatively avoid
frequent reallocations. After calling ` reserve ` , capacity will be greater
than or equal to ` self.len() + additional ` . Does nothing if capacity is
already sufficient.

