However, ` live() ` was deprecated in 1.7 in favour of ` on() ` , and
completely removed in 1.9. The ` live() ` signature:



    $(selector).live( eventName, function(){} );


... can be replaced with the following [ ` on() ` ](http://api.jquery.com/on/)
signature:



